 you choose which knights to bring and build a deck around them, then play cards each turn to carry out your plan.\n\nMixing and matching card combos is the heart of the game, and different knights support different playstyles. Floppy Knights has bright art and a friendly tone, is single-player and offers full controller support, so it suits anyone who enjoys deckbuilders or tactics games."}}